E_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"リサ","textMapHash":491246850,"text":"さあ、売上データはすでに十分集まったわ。お疲れ様。","nextNodeIds":[401540111]},{"nodeId":401540111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"リサ","textMapHash":2763530506,"text":"もちろん、もし引き続きお店を手伝ってくれるのなら、お姉さんはとっても嬉しいけど。","nextNodeIds":[401540112]},{"nodeId":401540112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"リサ","textMapHash":1175108322,"text":"これで、ジンにも報告できるわね、ふふっ…","nextNodeIds":[401540113]},{"nodeId":401540113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":2820594,"text":"旅人、パイモン、久しぶりだな。","nextNodeIds":[401540114]},{"nodeId":401540114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3808428778,"text":"ジン団長！","nextNodeIds":[401540115]},{"nodeId":401540115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"リサ","textMapHash":2389917866,"text":"来てくれたのね。ちょうど可愛い子ちゃんとの仕事の引き継ぎが終わって、騎士団に戻ろうとしていたところよ。","nextNodeIds":[401540116]},{"nodeId":401540116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":4092088002,"text":"ああ、他の騎士から大体の状況は聞いている。","nextNodeIds":[401540117]},{"nodeId":401540117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":4251422378,"text":"今回も旅人に手伝ってもらうことになるとは思わなかった。","nextNodeIds":[401540118]},{"nodeId":401540118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"リサ","textMapHash":3892787170,"text":"あら、こういう大切な仕事で成果を出すには、賢くて有能な協力者が不可欠なのよ。","nextNodeIds":[401540119]},{"nodeId":401540119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"リサ","textMapHash":571453850,"text":"だってわたくしだけだったら、ここまで効率よくこなせなかったもの。","nextNodeIds":[401540120]},{"nodeId":401540120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":2549252234,"text":"確かに、君たちの実績は驚くべきものだった。","nextNodeIds":[401540121]},{"nodeId":401540121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":1780563250,"text":"他の用事を済ませてから様子を見に来ようと思っていたが、なかなか時間が取れなくてな…せめて、面と向かって礼を言いたかったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[401540122,401540123]},{"nodeId":401540122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1673983130,"text":"ジン団長はずっと裏で支えてくれてた。","nextNodeIds":[401540124]},{"nodeId":401540124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":535317810,"text":"ああ、君たちのような優秀な仲間がいてくれて、本当に安心だ。","nextNodeIds":[401540125]},{"nodeId":401540125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"リサ","textMapHash":2021192770,"text":"ふふっ、この件が一段落したら、ちゃんとお休みをくれるかしら？","nextNodeIds":[401540126]},{"nodeId":401540126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"リサ","textMapHash":2382720698,"text":"最近、少し抜け毛が多い気がするわ。","nextNodeIds":[401540127]},{"nodeId":401540127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":2403371226,"text":"勿論だ。連日、苦労をかけるな。","nextNodeIds":[401540128]},{"nodeId":401540128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":336632226,"text":"君が毎日図書館に入り浸っているのを見て、ずっとそればかりだと退屈するのではないかと思った。それで君の才能をより発揮できるような仕事を手配したのだが…","nextNodeIds":[401540129]},{"nodeId":401540129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":3707331058,"text":"一気に負担をかけすぎてしまったか？","nextNodeIds":[401540130]},{"nodeId":401540130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"リサ","textMapHash":838562994,"text":"まあ、そんなことないわ。騎士団のみんなのサポートもあるし、頼もしい旅人もお仕事を手伝ってくれたもの。","nextNodeIds":[401540131]},{"nodeId":401540131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"リサ","textMapHash":1224242498,"text":"たまには本業に戻って、研究をするのもなかなか面白いわね。","nextNodeIds":[401540132]},{"nodeId":401540132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":437507866,"text":"そうか、そう思ってくれているならよかった。","nextNodeIds":[401540133]},{"nodeId":401540133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":3417893074,"text":"旅人、改めて感謝する。この報酬を受け取ってくれ。","nextNodeIds":[401540134]},{"nodeId":401540134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"リサ","textMapHash":3103122778,"text":"そうそう、お姉さんもあなたのために記念品を作ったの。気に入ってくれると嬉しいわ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":401540123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3617212210,"text":"これはみんなが頑張った結果だよ。","nextNodeIds":[401540124]},{"nodeId":401540107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":464764306,"text":"いつの間にかコツを掴んでた。","nextNodeIds":[401540108]},{"nodeId":401540108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"リサ","textMapHash":3184153034,"text":"ええ、やっぱりあなたって学習能力がとても高いのね。","nextNodeIds":[401540109]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4015401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_300300735:2529.301,204.921,-1126.802,0.000,221.111,0.000]","10"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[4015401],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"リサ","count":17},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","count":11},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":4},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","count":1},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":1}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[140154],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":625735446,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[334